  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful and false stereotype that white people are inherently prone to violent, criminal, or morally reprehensible behavior. This is a form of racial stereotyping that targets white people as a group, which is a form of racism. The stereotype is not based on any factual evidence but is instead a product of historical and contemporary prejudice.",
